  "ingredients": [
    "1 medium eggplant",
    "4 ounce fresh mozzarella cheese",
    "1 large fresh tomatoes",
    "2 tablespoon fresh basil",
    "1/4 cup olive oil"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Cut the ends off the eggplant, then cut into thin slices. Discard the smaller pieces that are mostly covered in skin. You'll want to end up with about 8 slices.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/grilled-eggplant-rolls/#wprm-recipe-59642-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grilled-eggplant-rolls-step-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice the tomato and mozzarella thinly as well. Julienne the basil leaves.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/grilled-eggplant-rolls/#wprm-recipe-59642-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grilled-eggplant-rolls-step-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat up a griddle or grill pan. Brush the eggplant slices with olive oil, then grill for a few minutes on each side.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/grilled-eggplant-rolls/#wprm-recipe-59642-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grilled-eggplant-rolls-step-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the eggplant softens and you are almost done cooking the second side, add some mozzarella and tomato slices on top.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/grilled-eggplant-rolls/#wprm-recipe-59642-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grilled-eggplant-rolls-step-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle on some basil, drizzle on a little olive oil, and season with salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/grilled-eggplant-rolls/#wprm-recipe-59642-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grilled-eggplant-rolls-step-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll up the eggplant and secure with a toothpick.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/grilled-eggplant-rolls/#wprm-recipe-59642-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grilled-eggplant-rolls-step-06.jpg"
    }
  ],
